Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.11), adduser
Recommends: iproute2
Suggests: docker.io, nodejs (>= 22), npm
Description: private Raspberry Pi monitoring, backup, and integration API
 OwnNode Agent provides a bearer-token-protected HTTP API for Raspberry Pi
 monitoring, Wake-on-LAN, optional idempotent media backup, and opt-in bank-SMS
 transaction intake for Actual Budget. Optional monitored services are selected
 by each client; storage and integration settings are selected by each
 installation.
